Your keen senses and quick reflexes alert you just in time. You sidestep behind a massive gravestone as three Zombies emerge from the swirling mist, their burial clothes hanging in tatters, their flesh gray and rotting. They moan hungrily, shuffling toward where you were standing just moments ago.

The element of surprise is yours. You have the advantage—but you still face three undead creatures animated by dark magic and insatiable hunger. You must fight them one at a time:

Special Ability - Undead Fortitude: When a Zombie is reduced to 0 STAMINA, immediately roll one die. On a result of 5-6, the Zombie refuses to stay down! It survives with 1 STAMINA and continues fighting.

